      "instance_name": "children_behind_barbed_wire",
      "label": "children standing behind barbed wire",
      "description": "A group of child survivors of the Holocaust, dressed in striped prison uniforms, are standing behind barbed wire in front of a wooden fence. Their somber expressions and confined posture suggest a historical, traumatic context. The barbed wire creates a visual barrier between the children and the viewer, emphasizing their captivity or institutionalization.",
