      "instance_name": "Holocaust",
      "label": "Holocaust",
      "description": "The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. It is one of the most horrific genocides in human history and is central to understanding the context of the image. The term 'Holocaust' is not visible in the image but is essential to interpret the text overlay and the historical gravity of the scene.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
